Ibyo Urumuri AI izafasha: ABARARIMU -Gutegura Amasomo, Gutegura ibibazo nibizamini, Gutegura gusobanukirwa amasomo 
Abanyeshuri: Gusobanukirwa amasomo,Kubaza ibibazo, Gufasha mumyigire, kwiga byinshi
UBUCURUZI: Inama kubucuruzi, Gutegura inyandiko, Gufasha gutegura gahunda yubucuruzi, Gufasha abakora ubucuruzi gufata imyanzuro 
UBUVUZI: Gutanga Inama rusange kubuzima, Gusobanukirwa amagambo akoreshwa mubuvuzi, Gufasha abantu igihe bagomba kubonana namuganga, Urumuri AI ntisimbura umuganga cyangwa undi mukozi wubuzima 
AI ASSISTANT: Urumuri AI izaba ifite AI assistant ishobora gusubiza ibibazo no Gufasha Abakoresha muburyo bworoshye 
INTEGO: Intego ya URUMURI AI ni ugutuma ikoranabuhanga rya AI rigera kubantu benshi Kandi rikabafasha mumyigire, Akazi, ubucuruzi, Ubuvuzi 
